<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Rugby Union-French win under-21 international.</title>
<headline>Rugby Union-French win under-21 international.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of under-21 international played at Donnybrook on Friday. This was the first under-21 international played between the two countries.</p>
<p>Ireland  13  France  40</p>
<p>--Dublin newsroom 353-1-661-3377.</p>
